.$\n\n| $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At})=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At})=A\\,{e}^{At}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At}) & =A\\,{e}^{At} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{e}^{5t} & t{e}^{5t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5{e}^{5t} & (5t+1){e}^{5t} \\\\ 0 & 5{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335092/field-1" "q-335092/field-2" "q-335092/field-3" "q-335092/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d4fc3ba4-d488-5156-88dc-837369269cef"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335092"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335108/field-1/e6ec2b17c50b6e2bf13a76240a536bff088ecbfdd18b7a2a3ae89ab3b222c772" :answer/id #uuid "e79ba278-9a70-5649-971e-d0a07b5a3668" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5\\sin(5t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335108/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7800a642-79a6-529a-b93b-7f216d4803d6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-335108/field-1/e6ec2b17c50b6e2bf13a76240a536bff088ecbfdd18b7a2a3ae89ab3b222c772" :answer-field/choices ["q-335108/field-1/e6ec2b17c50b6e2bf13a76240a536bff088ecbfdd18b7a2a3ae89ab3b222c772"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335108/field-2/a5fdd591c694aa7e820ab8cb8bb5c1551ffc83710d15403dff1d73abb7d4f3fb" :answer/id #uuid "dd105bd1-dc04-51b9-8422-82bf884f3c5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5\\cos(5t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335108/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "ee04b5af-b6d8-5583-b7fb-3a6e1b303560" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answe